# app

a shallot game.

```bash
# run the game
bun install
bun run dev

# build, then serve the build
bun run build
bun run preview
```

## hosting

`bun run dev`, `bun run preview` and the native shell serve the page with cross-origin isolation. elsewhere, physics runs single-threaded and logs once naming the missing headers.
# Change color on spacebar

Show a cube that starts out white. When I press the spacebar, it should turn green and stay green.
Before I press anything it should be white, and the change should happen the moment I hit space.

Keep it simple — one cube, keyboard only.
